{"name": "Perspective Protocol", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SHIFT YOUR PERSPECTIVE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re a tiny red robot with a full license to ignore the laws of reality. <strong>Shift between 2D and 3D </strong>perspectives to overcome obstacles and<strong> reach the exit!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174520/extras/43ae8d9fa90ec577881fabbb3c71beac.poster.avif?t=1781710550\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174520/extras/43ae8d9fa90ec577881fabbb3c71beac.webm?t=1781710550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>OBSTACLE OVERLOAD!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lasers! Elevators! Buttons! Rolling marbles! Every level is packed with the quirky gadgets of Dr. Gamblebert\u2019s toy factory. <strong>Think outside the box and bend your perspective</strong> to turn these toys into clever problem-solving tools!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174520/extras/6bdc4c247da5ffe89d45bdc85ca34c2a.poster.avif?t=1781710550\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174520/extras/6bdc4c247da5ffe89d45bdc85ca34c2a.webm?t=1781710550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DIVERSE ENVIRONMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse many unique levels, each filled with different obstacles and puzzles. Each area demands you to use your perspective-shifting powers in new creative ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174520/extras/dfd5b6a00ad9c447622691d908d4ef48.poster.avif?t=1781710550\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174520/extras/dfd5b6a00ad9c447622691d908d4ef48.webm?t=1781710550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore 3D levels in first-person.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Split the world and switch to 2D side-scrolling anytime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think outside the box to solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tackle a wide variety of obstacles and puzzle rooms.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Perspective Protocol is a first-person puzzle game where you manipulate perspective to solve puzzles. Switch between 2D and 3D to overcome obstacles and escape the facility of the evil Dr. Gamblebert.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174520/883af8c4f50254a1b8331b22bff7a4df42fbe4cd/header.jpg?t=1781710550", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Puzzle Platformer", "Puzzle", "First-Person", "Adventure", "Psychedelic", "Action"], "developers": "hasenbauer", "publishers": "hasenbauer", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4174520", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "1 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/X37tlUyIRF8", "first_seen": 1780264800.0, "review_rank": 519}